{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:15","answer":"안녕","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>将颜色对应到相应区域，描出同色区域的内部边界线的形状。仅保留内部边界线，就是对应颜色的提取。</p>","text":"将颜色对应到相应区域，描出同色区域的内部边界线的形状。仅保留内部边界线，就是对应颜色的提取。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"纸笔太难了，能简化一下吗？","html":"<p>好的，星星已全部标出：\n<img data-asset-id=\"asset-60b28284bbc27afd8ba26f19\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/f70995ad44b643f78be3175845c273ed.webp\"/></p>","text":"好的，星星已全部标出：","assetIds":["asset-60b28284bbc27afd8ba26f19"]},{"number":3,"title":"我不理解我提取出的东西","html":"<p>韩语</p>","text":"韩语","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"정답은안녕","messageHtml":"<p>这是一个里程碑，“정답은안녕”的意思是“答案是안녕”。</p>","messageText":"这是一个里程碑，“정답은안녕”的意思是“答案是안녕”。","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]}],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"\n<p>首先按照规则解出纸笔谜题。</p>\n<p><a data-asset-id=\"asset-dba150f080005cf97e418ec6\" href=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d69791e7390d4e198caa5a8c879e5cef.PNG\"><img data-asset-id=\"asset-dba150f080005cf97e418ec6\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d69791e7390d4e198caa5a8c879e5cef.PNG\"/></a></p>\n<p>将颜色对应到相应区域的分割线形状，填入提取图片，得到<code>정답은안녕</code>，即韩语的「答案是안녕」。所以最终答案为<code>안녕</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>颜色</th><td>红</td><td>橙</td><td>黄</td><td>绿</td><td>青</td><td>蓝</td><td>紫</td><td>褐</td></tr>\n<tr><th>区域分割线形状</th><td>ᄌ</td><td>ᅥ</td><td>ᄃ</td><td>ᅡ</td><td>ᅧ</td><td>ᄂ</td><td>ᄇ</td><td>ᅳ</td></tr>\n</table>","text":"首先按照规则解出纸笔谜题。\n\n将颜色对应到相应区域的分割线形状，填入提取图片，得到\n정답은안녕\n，即韩语的「答案是안녕」。所以最终答案为\n안녕\n。\n\n颜色\n红\n橙\n黄\n绿\n青\n蓝\n紫\n褐\n\n区域分割线形状\nᄌ\nᅥ\nᄃ\nᅡ\nᅧ\nᄂ\nᄇ\nᅳ","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-dba150f080005cf97e418ec6"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>成功解开谜题后，量子星云影响的设备恢复正常，同时从中浮现出一张碎纸片。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"fragment\" data-asset-id=\"asset-88c1caef86fc1757d1dd122a\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5fa4c6588c35484d9115c8b6bb4b88f0.webp\"/></p>","text":"成功解开谜题后，量子星云影响的设备恢复正常，同时从中浮现出一张碎纸片。","assetIds":["asset-88c1caef86fc1757d1dd122a"]},"interactive":{"html":"<ul>\n    <li>放置一些星星，使得每行每列均有三颗星星。星星不能相邻或对角相邻。</li>\n    <li>将所有没有星星的格子划分为一些区域。每个区域均为中心对称，且包含其对称中心。所有对称中心已标出。</li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"https://puzz.cipherpuzzles.com/penpa-edit/?m=solve&\" target=\"_blank\">在线做题链接（无答案检查）</a><br>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/ea2dcb4efa374362ad972a45f4603abe.webp\" class=\"pimg\">\n<style>\n    .pimg {\n        width: 600px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 740px) {\n        .pimg {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n    }\n</style>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":15,\"imgUrl\":\"47e9268416804784ba588311e65f8b67.svg\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"521px\",\"left\":\"768px\",\"veryFirst\":false}","pgid":2,"pg_name":"指南","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/47e9268416804784ba588311e65f8b67.svg"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-4bfc20db2e707698281d88df","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/47e9268416804784ba588311e65f8b67.svg","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/47e9268416804784ba588311e65f8b67.svg","mime":"image/svg+xml","size":2342,"sha256":"7ef7d51ddb8bbd3bd8450e5c7e7fa7b2c97da2431a2ed402b845b50739c51a0d","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-60b28284bbc27afd8ba26f19","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/f70995ad44b643f78be3175845c273ed.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/f70995ad44b643f78be3175845c273ed.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":25622,"sha256":"7beaff37fbe4b332c4746e731371e44b4ac1bc9f085b798fb6fa985b104b5aee","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:2"]},{"id":"asset-88c1caef86fc1757d1dd122a","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5fa4c6588c35484d9115c8b6bb4b88f0.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/5fa4c6588c35484d9115c8b6bb4b88f0.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":19816,"sha256":"ab1c1ccd5d742117ca9c6aa7cdb6adba349ff2aa6dbe66bf6dd3b82e7d8f406e","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["extended"]},{"id":"asset-b18d3df8c7a7a5271bc041e7","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/ea2dcb4efa374362ad972a45f4603abe.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/ea2dcb4efa374362ad972a45f4603abe.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":369916,"sha256":"7423c270fec47a3a1ef17d6621199e9c3279749558042d083f007d7b7e2b8a88","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]},{"id":"asset-dba150f080005cf97e418ec6","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d69791e7390d4e198caa5a8c879e5cef.PNG","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/d69791e7390d4e198caa5a8c879e5cef.PNG","mime":"image/png","size":90084,"sha256":"75c631fa938b732a210c90959311e5702ed3652eda31fc3aa44dc93e34dea09f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
